`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"Point Claude to a message thread. It'll find the relevant conversation, research solutions, and then write to your notes for structured, organized information you can access anywhere."}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(i,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"I just got a text from Sarah asking me to bring dessert to Saturday's potluck—there will be about 15 people."}),(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"Can you read my Messages to see the full context, then help me figure out what to make? I need something that's impressive but not too complicated, travels well, and can be made Friday night since Saturday morning I'll be busy."}),(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"Research dessert options that fit those criteriasave recipe opping list to my Notes app—group the shopping list by store section so I'm not running back and forth, and include any technique tips that'll help me nail it."}),(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"To ensure correct formatting in my notes, using HTML tags to create natural line breaks. Use abbreviations and concise language so the note isn't overly long."})]}),`
