`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:["Then, in ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://claude.ai/customize/connectors",children:"Settings > Connectors"}),", click ‘Browse Connectors’, and enable the ",(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Read and Send iMessages"})," and ",(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Read and Write Apple Notes"})," extensions under ‘Desktop extensions’. These are extensions of Claude for Desktop on a Mac, not iPhone integrations: Claude reads the threads and writes the notes on your computer, and as long as Messages and Notes sync over iCloud, your phone stays in step with no phone-side setup."]}),`
