`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"Claude can now connect with your device's system apps to help you take action directly from your conversations. When you chat with Claude, it can draft messages, emails, or calendar events, find locations, and manage reminders — all seamlessly integrated with your mobile apps. That mobile feature drafts new messages from your phone; reading an existing thread and writing the note, as in this walkthrough, runs through the Claude desktop app's extensions on a Mac."}),`
